WEBVTT

44:34.371 --> 44:36.873
Are you all right?
I'm proud of you, Sheriff.

44:36.957 --> 44:39.625
A lesser man would've talked
under such torture.

44:40.419 --> 44:42.712
I sure hope this isn't permanent.

44:42.796 --> 44:46.049
Still no word from Star Command.
We're not that far from the space port.

44:46.133 --> 44:48.551
The door. It's open!
We're free!

44:48.635 --> 44:49.761
Woody, we don't know
what's out there!

44:49.845 --> 44:51.137
I'll tell you wha...

44:53.390 --> 44:55.600
They're gonna eat us, Buzz!
Do something quick!

44:55.684 --> 44:57.518
Shield your eyes.

44:59.480 --> 45:02.315
It's not working. I recharged it
before I left. It should be good for...
